<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<style>
html { background: #ffffff; }
body {
  width: 720pt; height: 405pt; margin: 0; padding: 0;
  background: #F4F6F6;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
}
.header {
  height: 60pt;
  background: #1C2833;
  padding: 15pt 35pt;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}
.header h1 {
  font-size: 24pt;
  color: #F4F6F6;
  margin: 0;
}
.content {
  padding: 15pt 35pt 45pt 35pt;
  flex: 1;
  display: flex;
  gap: 18pt;
}
.left {
  flex: 1;
}
.right {
  flex: 1;
}
.card {
  background: #ffffff;
  border-left: 4pt solid #70AD47;
  border-radius: 5pt;
  padding: 8pt;
  margin-bottom: 8pt;
  box-shadow: 0 2pt 4pt rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}
.card h2 {
  font-size: 11pt;
  color: #1C2833;
  margin: 0 0 4pt 0;
  font-weight: bold;
}
.card ul {
  margin: 0;
  padding-left: 14pt;
  font-size: 8pt;
  color: #2E4053;
  line-height: 1.3;
}
.stats {
  display: flex;
  gap: 4pt;
  margin-top: 4pt;
}
.stat-box {
  flex: 1;
  background: #F0F6F0;
  padding: 4pt;
  border-radius: 3pt;
  text-align: center;
}
.stat-box .number {
  font-size: 11pt;
  color: #70AD47;
  font-weight: bold;
  margin: 0;
}
.stat-box .label {
  font-size: 7pt;
  color: #2E4053;
  margin: 2pt 0 0 0;
}
.chart-container {
  background: #ffffff;
  border-radius: 6pt;
  padding: 10pt;
  box-shadow: 0 2pt 5pt rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  height: 100%;
}
.chart-container h3 {
  font-size: 12pt;
  color: #1C2833;
  margin: 0 0 6pt 0;
  font-weight: bold;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="header">
  <h1>红利资产：确定性的避风港</h1>
</div>
<div class="content">
  <div class="left">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>🛡️ 配置逻辑</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>低利率环境吸引力提升</li>
        <li>稳定现金流回报</li>
        <li>估值低波动小</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat-box">
          <p class="number">5-6%</p>
          <p class="label">股息率</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
          <p class="number">10-15x</p>
          <p class="label">PE估值</p>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-box">
          <p class="number">低</p>
          <p class="label">波动率</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
      <h2>📈 数据支撑</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>广东分红创历史新高</li>
        <li>高股息策略跑赢大盘</li>
        <li>央企分红率超35%</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="right">
    <div class="chart-container placeholder" id="dividend-chart" style="width: 100%; height: 100%;"></div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
